## Summary

> **We do NOT need Modelica source files or model dependencies.**  
> **We only need: FMU + YAML + Test CSVs**  
> **System handles everything else: validation, deployment, API generation.**

This standardized approach ensures every FMU is thoroughly tested, properly documented, and production-ready before deployment.
